                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s26IHA"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>وَ قَالَ الَّذيْنَ لَا يَرْجُوْنَ لَقَانَاً لَوْلَا أُنْزِلَ عَليْنَا المَليكَةُ</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#15r">-15r</locus>وَأَنْتُمْ تُبْصِرُوْنَ , الرِّجَالَ شَهْوَةً مِنْ دُوْنِ النِّسَإِ بَلْ اَنْتُم قَوْمٌ تَجْهَلُوْنَ</explicit>
                     <note>25:21-27:55. Red verse markers formed as dots, commas or letters hā. Titles of suras rubricated. Ihmāl marks (rā’-s). Some extensions of letters and words into the margin or words completed on the following line, sometimes in the margin. Few words left uncompleted at the end of a line, sometimes without diacritics or vocalization, and written in full on the following line. Vowels in a lighter black ink, some corrected. Correction by the scribe in the margin (fol. 12r), and corrections in the light ink.</note>
                     <note/>
